Description: terminal interface for managing Bluetooth devices
 bluetui scans, pairs, connects and trusts Bluetooth devices from a
 terminal interface, driving BlueZ over D-Bus. It covers the common
 bluetoothctl operations without the interactive prompt.
 .
 Keybindings and colours are configurable through a TOML file, whose
 location can be overridden with --config.
